            "detailed_description": "Build, Battle and Brawl your way out of trouble!<br>\t\t\tPlay through all three classic Indiana Jones™ movies and relive your favorite Indy adventures in the tongue-in-cheek worlds of LEGO®.<br>\t\t\t<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Explore and Discover</strong> - Battle enemies, solve puzzles, and seek out the world's greatest treasures.<br>\t\t\t</li><li><strong>More Than 60 Playable Characters</strong> - Take control of Indy, his friends, and even his enemies. Team up with a friend and together search for fortune and glory.<br>\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Whip Into Action!</strong> - Attack and disarm enemies, swing over perilous pits, and interact with LEGO® objects and puzzles!<br>\t\t\t</li></ul>",
