                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This was also a nostalga trip down memory lane i played the complete saga by myself when i first got it but this time when i got this game i played it with my friend sam it was fun :) we figured out the jumping glitch TURN ON VSYNC Anyway heres my rating of everything starting with levels \n\nRAIDERS OF THE LOST ARK: 9/10 \nTEMPLE OF DOOM: 10/10\nTHE LAST CRUSADE: 9.5/10 (I Give it that because of motorcycle escape)\n\nBEST LEVEL: W1 L1 The Lost Temple\nWORST LEVEL: W3 L3 Motorcycle Escape \n\nFAVORITE CHARACTER: Indiana Jones\nLEAST FAVORITE CHARACTER: Fedora \n\nPRICE: Worth it \nGameplay: Good\nGraphics: Good\nStory: Amazing \nPC Specs: Potato\nOverall Rating: 10/10",
